<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58855" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κονᾰβ-έω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόναβος</span>) 
			Ep.
		 Verb, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>resound,
				clash, ring</i>, esp. of metallic bodies, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφὶ δὲ πήληξ σμερδαλέον κονάβησε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					15.648
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				21.593
			</span></i>: late in pres., <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.144
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Cereal.
			</span></i>); <i>re-echo</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφὶ δὲ νῆες σμερδαλέον κονάβησαν
					ἀϋσάντων ὑπ᾽ Ἀχαιῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.334
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				16.277
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφὶ δὲ δῶμα σμ. κον.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					17.542
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφὶ δὲ γαῖα σμ. κον</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				840
			</span></i>: late in Prose, of a river, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				2.145
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
